 "description": "GRAVITY GRID — GravityField, the Ewald-style force splitter. Near forces stay exact per-particle; far mass folds into grid cells (gravGridCols) rebuilt within a per-frame budget (gravGridBudget), with ghost far-cluster gravity beyond that. Shows cell count, rebuild cost, budget used, and ghost mode state. The overlay knob draws the grid for the eyes only. If orbits drift when planet counts rise, check budget starvation here."
